{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"body":"That first PR carried an undeclared file, portal/next-env.d.ts, alongside the one declared change. Root caused to two compounding defects and reproduced the file mutation exactly: npm run build rewrites it, while npm run ts:check and npx jest leave it untouched."},"env_id":"8c3ef925-fbdc-4d88-8d59-f391cf59568c","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789933480199774001,"uuid":"d720d694-6ef5-44a3-bbc6-9c4a811aea89"}